{
  "$comment": "Developer Harness V2 declarative architecture contract (Phase 1). This file DECLARES intended authority; it enforces nothing at runtime. Runtime enforcement is introduced in Phase 2+ and authoritative enforcement remains GitHub rulesets, environments and the existing CI/Staging gates. See 02-architecture-contract.md and 03-authority-and-threat-model.md.",
  "version": 1,
